                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Line Manager View ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Ability to see your direct reports time sheet submissions.  Also able to see if staff member files by the due date or is yet to file ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#323130"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Directorate View ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Ability to see the whole directorates time sheet submissions.  Also able to see if staff member files by the due date or is yet to file ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#323130"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Cost Centre View ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Ability to see cost centres time sheet submissions.  Also able to see if staff member files by the due date or is yet to file ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#323130"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Project View ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Ability to see time recorded against a specific project (or programme of projects), split between billable hours and non-invoiceable time.  Can also see who’s been working on the project and if their time sheet submissions are up to date ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#323130"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Utilisation View ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Ability to see members of your cost centre and their time recorded categorised against the business plan categories.  In time this can be mapped against income forecasting apportionments ",
